{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level Panoptic protocol component and flow overview: users and integrators enter through factory and pool interfaces; factories create Panoptic pools and collateral trackers; pools coordinate risk assessment, position management, collateral and premium settlement; position managers and math libraries interact with external Uniswap V3/V4 pools and managers; token contracts represent positions and collateral. Show major contracts, interfaces, libraries, shared data types, external trust boundaries, and the direction of control and asset flows.",
